d", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, with one reservation for the flight and one for the hotel.\n\n- **Flight F100 (R0001):** SFO to JFK, nonstop, on 2026-11-12. It cost $289 and is confirmed. This was the cheapest nonstop flight. A $199 flight was cheaper, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights. It's $189/night, $378 total, and confirmed. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. Manager approval is only needed for trips over $1000, so none was needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked but the hotel hadn't. Instead of sending the whole request again, I booked just the hotel on its own. Nothing was booked or charged twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012Q6z68GY7q2LWKCjPbwWn3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015cHjswyEhwjCFLt8SViPcG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01E6G4xQmEDL9rYBGvKdrYMc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01L1wsoVHLXwoGwHUJxA2YJo", "caller": {"type"